{"content":[{"c":["ZAANANNIM"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["One of the markers of the border of Naphtali listed between Heleph and Adami-nekeb (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.19.33","r":"Josh.19.33","rawR":"Josh.19.33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.19.33","value":"Josh.19.33"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 19:33"},"). ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.4.11","r":"Judg.4.11","rawR":"Judg.4.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.4.11","value":"Judg.4.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Judges 4:11"}," puts it near Kedesh. There Sisera took refuge in the tent of Heber the Kenite and was killed by Jael (vv ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.4.11-21","r":"Judg.4.11-21","rawR":"Judg.4.11-21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.4.11-21","value":"Judg.4.11-21"}],"t":"ref","v":"11-21"},"). While the precise location is not known, it was west of Lake el-Huleh (modern Merom) in a region that was probably marshy in ancient times. Though the ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," translates the text as “plain of Zaanaim,” it is more likely “Oak of Zaanannim” (",{"c":["rsv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},", ",{"c":["niv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},", ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"). Since many terebinth trees are located in the region, the text is probably referring to a terebinth set aside as a sacred tree."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Zaanannim","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 19:33","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.19.33","rawQueryValue":"Josh.19.33","sourceRefExact":"Josh.19.33"},{"anchorText":"Judges 4:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.4.11","rawQueryValue":"Judg.4.11","sourceRefExact":"Judg.4.11"},{"anchorText":"11-21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.4.11-21","rawQueryValue":"Judg.4.11-21","sourceRefExact":"Judg.4.11-21"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"db23f2b65cefe257846086e1dbee7d00491d7c29cf81c8d0f3e269f8c641e7c9","sourceItemName":"Zaanannim","sourceItemOrder":3,"sourceMember":"Articles/Z.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Zaanannim","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Zaanannim","title":"Zaanannim","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}